# no-cache = browsers may store but MUST revalidate (ETag 304s keep it fast).
# The museum updates in place; a stale script against fresh data renders
# blank pages. Revalidation is the durable fix, not cache-busting params.
#
# X-Clacks-Overhead: the Terry Pratchett "GNU" convention from the Discworld
# novels — "a man is not dead while his name is still spoken." One header
# line per data/memorials.json entry, BUILD-STAMPED by scripts/stamp-stats.mjs
# between the "# clacks:start/end" markers above (same chrome-system pattern
# as the masthead/footer and the lobby door counts) — future memorials join
# the overhead automatically, no hand-editing this file.
# scripts/registry-validate.mjs recomputes the same names and hard-fails the
# build if this file has drifted from data/memorials.json. If Cloudflare
# Pages ever collapses repeated same-key header lines into one on the wire,
# switch to a single comma-joined line instead — see docs/OPERATIONS.md.
